[{"date":"2022-06-17T12:51:04","link":"https:\/\/blog.myswimpro.com\/2022\/06\/17\/try-this-1500m-usrpt-swim-workout\/","title":{"rendered":"Try This 1,500m USRPT Swim Workout"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you\u2019re eager to improve your sprinting and drop time in the 100 and 50 of any stroke, Ultra-Short Race Pace Training (USRPT) may be just what you need.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">USRPT takes the \u201cfluff\u201d out of your swim workouts, focusing the majority of your time in the water on race pace swims to train your body to perform at its highest level. <a href=\"https:\/\/blog.myswimpro.com\/2017\/10\/23\/what-is-ultra-short-race-pace-training\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Learn more about the science behind USRPT here.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<figure><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/enzNVsYPgHI\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For a taste of USRPT, try this 1,500-meter swim workout! Go all out on the 25s in the main set, aiming to reach your goal pace for a 50 or 100 free. If you are training for a 50 or 100 of a different stroke, feel free to swap out the drills and freestyle sets for that stroke.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>1,500m Sprint Swim Workout<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"788\" height=\"985\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=788%2C985&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-19103\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=819%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 819w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=150%2C188&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?resize=450%2C563&amp;ssl=1 450w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/myswimpro-app-usrpt-swim-workout.png?w=1080&amp;ssl=1 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Related: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/blog.myswimpro.com\/2022\/01\/27\/usrpt-ii-swim-training-plan\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Try the MySwimPro USRPT Training Plan<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>Distance: <\/strong>1,500 meters\/yards<\/li><li><strong>Duration: <\/strong>45 minutes<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Warmup<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>1&#215;300 Freestyle @ 5:00 Easy<\/li><li>4&#215;50 Kick @ 1:10 Moderate with Fins<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pre-Set<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>4&#215;25 Drill @ :40 Moderate with Fins &amp; Snorkel<\/li><li>8&#215;25 Freestyle @ :40, Odds Cruise, Evens Race Pace<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Main Set (2x)<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>8&#215;25 Freestyle @ :40 Race Pace with Fins &amp; Paddles<\/li><li>1&#215;100 Freestyle @ 2:00 Easy<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Cool Down<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>4&#215;25 Freestyle @ :30 Easy<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you liked this workout, you\u2019ll find more just like it in the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.myswimpro.com\/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MySwimPro app<\/a>, plus personalized Training Plans, Technique Videos and Analytics. <a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\/?coupon=SWIM35\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Save $35 on your first year of training with code SWIM35!<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"788\" height=\"394\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?resize=788%2C394&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18558\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?w=1000&amp;ssl=1 1000w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-5.png?resize=450%2C225&amp;ssl=1 450w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n","protected":false}},{"date":"2022-06-09T12:40:42","link":"https:\/\/blog.myswimpro.com\/2022\/06\/09\/try-this-1800m-swim-workout\/","title":{"rendered":"Try This 1,800m Swim Workout"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">When your usual swim routine starts feeling monotonous, it\u2019s time to mix it up! And this 1,800-meter workout should do the trick.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In the true spirit of variety, this workout mixes different strokes and a bit of dryland in the Pre-Set to really get the blood flowing! In the Main Set, you\u2019ll start with no equipment on the first round, and add fins and paddles in rounds two and three to up the ante.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Give this workout a shot, and let us know what you think in the comments!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Related: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/blog.myswimpro.com\/2022\/05\/27\/try-this-30-minute-swimming-dryland-workout\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>Try This 30-Minute Swim &amp; Dryland Challenge<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>45-Minute Variety Swim Workout<\/strong><\/h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\/\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"788\" height=\"985\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=788%2C985&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18848\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=819%2C1024&amp;ssl=1 819w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=240%2C300&amp;ssl=1 240w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=768%2C960&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=150%2C188&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?resize=450%2C563&amp;ssl=1 450w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/06\/1800m-swim-workout-myswimpro-app.png?w=1080&amp;ssl=1 1080w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li><strong>Distance: <\/strong>1,800 yards\/meters<\/li><li><strong>Duration: <\/strong>45 minutes<\/li><li><strong>Equipment: <\/strong>Fins, paddles &amp; snorkel<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Warmup<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>1 x 300 Freestyle @ 5:00 Every 3rd 25 Backstroke<\/li><li>4 x 50s Freestyle\/Stroke by 25 @ 1:00<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Pre-Set (2x)<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>1 x 25 Butterfly + 5 Pushups @ 0:50<\/li><li>1 x 25 Backstroke + 5 Squats @ 0:50<\/li><li>1 x 25 Breaststroke + 5 Leg Raises @ 0:50<\/li><li>1 x 25 Freestyle + Russian Twists @ 0:50<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Main Set (3x)&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Round 1: No equipment, Round 2: Fins, Round 3: Fins &amp; Paddles<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>1 x 200 Freestyle @ 4:00 Negative Split<\/li><li>4 x 25s Freestyle Descend 1-4 @ :30 (w\/ Snorkel)<\/li><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Cool Down<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">4 x 50s Freestyle Silent Swimming @ 1:00<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Like this workout? For more just like it, plus personalized Training Plans and 1-on-1 coaching, download the <a href=\"http:\/\/www.myswimpro.com\/download\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MySwimPro app<\/a>! <a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\/?coupon=SWIM35\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Save $35 on your first year of training with code SWIM35 &gt;<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/myswimpro.com\/coach\/\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"788\" height=\"394\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?resize=788%2C394&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-18561\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?w=1000&amp;ssl=1 1000w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?resize=300%2C150&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?resize=768%2C384&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?resize=150%2C75&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.myswimpro.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/05\/footer-myswimpro-app-swim-workouts-8.png?resize=450%2C225&amp;ssl=1 450w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\" \/><\/a><\/figure><\/div>\n","protected":false}}]